WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.360
Two houses.

2
00:00:01.410 --> 00:00:05.110
A farmhouse with 1500
carved over the door,

3
00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.360
and a gentry house carpeted with crimson.

4
00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:11.810
A boy arrives with no surname and no land.

5
00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:13.820
He starts below both.

6
00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:18.760
Years later, he sits at a table,
moving papers we cannot yet read.

7
00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:21.960
One by one, the keys slide across to him.

8
00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:25.570
"The guest was now the
master of Wuthering Heights".

9
00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:27.600
He never kills anyone.

10
00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:32.190
So how does a man with no family
name end up owning both houses?

11
00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:36.740
In this mission, you'll see how the
two houses stand for two classes.

12
00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:39.380
You'll ask who could
inherit land in those days,

13
00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:41.740
and who owned a wife's property.

14
00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:45.400
Your mission: work out
how he takes both houses.
